The lexer (src/main/kotlin/io/github/alexanderuv/intelliswift/lexer) and the parser
(src/main/kotlin/io/github/alexanderuv/intelliswift/parser) are ports of parts of swift-syntax
to Kotlin, in particular Sources/SwiftParser/Lexer/Cursor.swift, RegexLiteralLexer.swift,
TokenPrecedence.swift, Recovery.swift and the SwiftParser grammar productions, and the keyword
and character tables derived from swift-syntax's CodeGeneration sources.

